Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.22,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:56.84,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,498)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.55,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.97,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:11.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:26.79,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:33.71,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.09,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:40.39,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.44,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:04.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.00,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:11.33,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:13.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.84,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.54,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:33.04,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}索隆VS龍馬與\N喬巴的憤怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:36.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他打了一個洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:39.93,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,把突刺的力量打飛出去... 需要相當大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.51,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,看來是平手。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:53.65,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,差點被你得手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:57.44,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？那個腰帶男是什麼時候反擊的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.07,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,幾乎... 是同時...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:03.12,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個人的斬擊也飛出去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:08.36,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個武士殭屍是靠我的影子才能動的，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.75,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,但他活著的時候\N一定是個非凡的武士。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:18.13,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,有可能那兩個人作為劍客擁有同類型的實力。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:23.43,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,代表他們擁有相同的破壞力。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:27.10,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,這場比賽不會拖太久。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.19,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}前奏曲...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.19,0:03:33.01,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鐵鋼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.19,0:03:33.01,Note,Ryuuma,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}鐵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:34.96,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,破壞武器的技巧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:36.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:37.97,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}閃！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.38,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鬼熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:49.53,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}嘉禾舞...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:50.76,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}前方跳躍！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:50.76,Note,Ryuuma,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}前方跳躍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:53.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:54.28,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}拔刀...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:55.80,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}城門！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.34,Thoughts,Zoro,0,0,0,,被他得手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.56,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,柱子斷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.63,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,等、等一下！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,整個地板要塌了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:13.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.41,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,抓緊了，我們撤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:20.17,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,天花板塌下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.90,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}七十二煩惱大砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.90,Note,Zoro,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}七十二煩惱鳳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.10,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}波爾卡連擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.25,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}武器左手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好險！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.86,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,小心！你會掉下去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:07.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我在打滑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他們怎麼能站穩腳跟？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:23.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,再這樣下去，我的刀會被砍斷...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:28.99,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這具屍體的身軀和技巧幾乎跟那位傳說中的武士本人一模一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:49.32,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}一刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.46,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}飛龍...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:53.90,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三步必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.05,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}燕口斬！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:02.90,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火焰！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:14.22,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,他的傷口燃燒了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.11,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,我輸了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:33.52,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,秋水，曾經侍奉傳說中的武士的名刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:33.52,Note,Ryuuma,0,0,100,,秋水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:39.21,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,這把刀在你的指揮下一定會感到滿意的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:43.71,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那個武士剛才是不是說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.01,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那麼就是說...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.18,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那、那代表什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.99,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,代表...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:51.68,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,比賽結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.62,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我從沒見過這種戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.40,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個武士...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:07:02.27,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,根本沒有認真跟我打！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:05.75,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那還真是一場好戰。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:17.03,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,我為...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:21.50,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,給了這個武士的身體一場完敗而感到抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:24.24,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,能感到恥辱就已經足夠了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:27.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這才是身心兼備的真正劍客。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:30.26,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,要是能在你活著的時候遇見你就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:38.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這、這是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:39.87,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,影子回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:44.02,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,五年的漫長歲月後，我的影子終於回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:46.43,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這把刀我收下了，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:49.34,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,就當作這場決鬥從未發生過吧，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:51.70,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,和之國的武士。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:08:01.66,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？被自己的同伴\N抓住是什麼感覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:06.13,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,你那奇怪能力想餵我鹽巴失敗了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.84,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,他很強...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:12.46,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,可惡！沒想到香吉士會踢羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.82,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這東西已經不再是香吉士了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.42,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,香吉士是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.26,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,我要殺了你，該死的混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:26.52,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,很遺憾，他們已經不再有身為你朋友的記憶了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:30.95,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,剛成為殭屍的還可能\N殘留一些原來的自我，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:34.70,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,但現在身體和影子已經完全融合了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:37.03,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,他們的人性已經永遠消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:40.51,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,他們現在是我忠實的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:44.22,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,而且對殭屍來說，命令是絕對的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:51.02,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,看到你墮落到這種地步我幾乎感到高興，乂乂乂克！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:58.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你曾經拯救了無數人的生命，\N那就是我身為醫生深深敬仰你的原因，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,包括你對殭屍的研究。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.72,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,死亡...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.69,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,它總是毫無預警地降臨...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:11.89,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,因此，死者和生者之間有許多話來不及說...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:13.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不是很多年...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.49,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,哪怕只有幾分鐘就夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:19.55,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果有辦法讓死者哪怕只復活片刻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:23.49,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,就算那是邪惡的異端之術...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:27.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對被帶回來的人也會是莫大的慰藉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:35.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,所以，當你談到復活死者的時候，我以為你的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:38.14,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是一個真正的醫生才會說的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:44.68,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,蠢貨！我為什麼要為陌生人做那種事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:49.69,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,他們找我幫忙跟你敬仰我的原因一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.00,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,因為我是天才！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:56.19,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,全都是為了錢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:10:01.43,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我根本不想幫助那些從世界各地不斷湧來的病人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:03.45,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,「請救救我父親！」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:04.77,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,「救救我的孩子！」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:06.32,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,「救救我的男朋友！」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:09.37,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,真是煩死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.34,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,太麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:16.38,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我必須為那些連一條命都救不了的無能庸醫買單。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.93,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你能體會身為天才的痛苦嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:23.78,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你要不要尊敬我是你的自由，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:26.15,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,但你因為對我失望而憤怒本身就很可笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:30.17,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,如果你因為那些荒謬的理想而容不下我這個醫生...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.47,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那你只是在欺騙自己，笨馴鹿！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.71,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你想教我什麼是醫生該做的事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:38.97,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我沒打算告訴你任何事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:41.95,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我已經不把你當成醫生了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那些殭屍也是一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.91,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,它們只是按照你的意志行動的空殼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,它們不是活著的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:53.00,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不要玩弄生命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.72,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,真是殘忍的一番話。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:11:00.45,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,它們明明在你眼前動著，你卻否定它們的生命？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:05.06,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,賦予死者新的生命是真正的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:08.93,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你怎麼能否認這個事實的存在？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.09,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:20.40,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那麼，舔地板吧，乂德莉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.70,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,是的，乂乂乂克大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:32.10,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你看過那個房間了吧，喬巴醫生？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.94,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那是我的房間。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:41.55,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那些全是舞台女演員維多利亞·乂德莉生前的照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:45.26,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我完全愛上了她。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:50.67,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,不只是我，全國的男人都為如此美貌傾倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.77,Flashbacks,Cindry,0,0,0,,修好了，醫生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:12:00.09,Flashbacks,Hogback,0,0,0,,抱、抱歉，我不該只為了縫扣子就打擾我的病人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:03.17,Flashbacks,Cindry,0,0,0,,沒關係的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.13,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,一個非常受歡迎卻毫不做作的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.62,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,對家人忠誠，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:20.21,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,對所有人都很善良... 真是一個很棒的女人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:22.22,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,但是她...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:37.00,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,拒絕了我的求婚，一個什麼都有的醫生的求婚...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.19,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,全是因為她那該死的未婚夫...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.48,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,然後...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:44.61,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,一個難以置信的消息傳到了我耳中...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.63,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂德莉... 在一場事故中去世了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.54,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我的痛苦無法言喻...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:55.36,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我放棄了工作...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:59.63,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,就在那時候，一個巨大的男人出現在我面前...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:03.21,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我的主人，乂科·乂利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:07.41,Flashbacks,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂乂乂克醫生，借我你的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:18.06,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,於是我們約定，以他的奇蹟般的能力復活乂德莉作為交換，我留在這艘船上。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:20.94,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我偷走了她的遺體...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:25.40,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,透過這樣做，我輕鬆地得到了對女演員乂德莉的支配權！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.22,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂德莉醬！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.44,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,如果所有盤子都消失就好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:40.25,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我不在乎她體內裝的是誰的靈魂...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.61,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,只要她擁有那副美貌就行了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.17,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那就是乂德莉醬的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:50.01,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我充滿喜悅，她也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:54.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我給了她作為人類在這個世界上第二次生活的機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.82,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你管這個叫做人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,讓她停下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:13.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,一個心靈和身體之間沒有連結的人不能稱之為人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:16.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果你只是使用沒有靈魂的軀體...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:19.10,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那你只是在製造怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:21.42,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你創造殭屍害得大家都不幸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:25.80,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,既然我已經知道了這些，我絕不會放過你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:30.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,別用你那有限的醫術來跟我談「生命」，海賊鹿！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.31,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂德莉醬，收拾他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.89,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我要把你們兩個都變成傀儡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:41.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你應該感恩，喬巴醫生。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:47.57,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,等你死了，你就會成為\N你所敬仰之人的助手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.45,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}稜角盤斬...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:53.51,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}一！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:54.45,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:55.07,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.37,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,住手...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:00.62,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:05.13,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:13.38,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,別因為對手是女人就小看她！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我已經增強了她的戰鬥力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.75,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你不必聽他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:22.90,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,我會殺了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:30.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我替你感到遺憾。你已經死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:33.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你的家人要是知道這件事會怎麼想？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:35.87,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,放... 放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:40.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,渾身縫補，變成只是一個沒有思想的士兵...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你的親人不忍心看到你這個樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.38,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,你這該死的... 放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:48.55,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你與生俱來的心已經死了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:51.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你的身體在別人的意志下移動...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.18,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那算什麼人生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:55.44,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你不相信自己的眼睛嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:16:00.06,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,接受吧！這就是人類永恆的夢想，死者的復活！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.90,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,死者已經復活了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,所以只要能動就夠了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.84,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,人類擁有比那更多的自由！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:12.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你根本沒有把他們當人看！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅賓！快餵她鹽巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:21.45,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,狗圍欄！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:22.24,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,吉五郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:23.81,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,保護乂德莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.81,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,把那個礙事的傢伙解決掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:30.96,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,失敗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:31.90,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:33.82,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:36.42,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}一百零八...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.65,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}煩惱大砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:44.35,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,住手，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.35,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}十二輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.35,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}十二輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.40,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,你這礙事的...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.35,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:00.87,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,你為什麼也攻擊我？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:04.62,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,別擋我的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:09.46,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,你現在惹怒我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.59,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,那是你才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.21,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,我收到了那個命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:15.38,Main,Jigoro,0,0,0,,是我才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:19.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,喂，你們在幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.18,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:23.27,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你們應該合作-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:24.17,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.40,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,真是有趣的一幕，你不覺得嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:31.40,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,全是因為那個「解決礙事傢伙」的命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.89,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,就算記憶被抹除了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:37.70,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,看來那兩個人的本性就是永遠在互相爭鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:38.97,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我很震驚...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:43.74,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這裡好像是很高的塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:49.00,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你要不要試著命令他們跳下去？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:51.34,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你在暗示什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.81,0:17:54.42,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,那正是我要說的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.59,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,跳！跳下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:59.97,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你們兩個，給我跳下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.01,Main,Both,0,0,0,,是。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.06,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,不、不，等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.76,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們不要。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.79,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,不可原諒！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:24.93,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你騙了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:25.90,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你是最低等的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.41,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你不是人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:33.09,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,等魯夫打倒乂利亞之後，所有殭屍都會被淨化的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:36.45,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我只想狠狠揍你一頓，乂乂乂克！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:37.26,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂德莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.75,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,幫我爭取點時間！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.43,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我要離開這裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.32,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你為什麼不回答？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.26,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,就算你輸了，我再給你一個影子就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:45.90,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,不用擔心死亡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:50.88,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,我的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.40,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,動不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.78,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,乂、乂德莉！
Comment: 0,0:00:57.22,0:01:01.51,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,550)}Title card artist\N{\fs40}
